", "id": "1148192932456664", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974625_1148192935789997_1416656799652225989_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0ZlkWQflaj8Q7kNvwHpR12I&_nc_oc=AdqkNFfmgYXRR9FZS1zpJmHQPPSH3VYn0g-NN-QHb0mr1jrAYPW53N6i9YujH8EynL0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6p-k04jOXWsY9eIQbPc3i8n8qwtm6PsoR8rYG4sS6A4g&oe=69F9F3B6"}, {"file_name": "pd-screen-2.png", "id": "2332569856899945", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974820_2332569860233278_8835659424562109361_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-e29IJLA8tcQ7kNvwGj9hSP&_nc_oc=AdoCmu-iFNF3m1jFx6o1mN9ShyKwIG0KuOfLio0pbgVbwcFFlE905EhELJy4XIpHNYc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7v7kNRJFXet-e6FDZGQf8-lRAfahBJ7tQ5EIlfh0tGrA&oe=69FA0376"}, {"file_name": "pd-screen-5.png", "id": "430728135872291", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003247_430728139205624_5946641524650245644_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RxYeBL2mFkQQ7kNvwGlmJ_D&_nc_oc=AdrHHJdAE2uqd_nv88rIDO58s9lIXvcFGmOxKTH1_R51pibLAtSmi48WSqVxb3zNczg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4TVVsvHKoMoThRVGzzqlqy0wc0b1b3YXJlkFKF5GaLJg&oe=69FA05A2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "videoscreen.png", "id": "986130542781323", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974594_986130546114656_4585000279316381076_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wlp-9q54E-oQ7kNvwHv5iwn&_nc_oc=AdoNtvex0VF6-bUpTfEJdwJVGn-7GU-0IRl9AryMfazI_1XkoP-AuOqbPYZ-8DiQY7g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7jUnJfrqXGSdQa5XB2WHjIRTEgXtOYpqbkxT__ZGee9A&oe=69F9F72E"}, "display_name": "Paradiddle", "keywords": ["drum", "beat", "music", "piano", "instrument"], "long_description": "So much more than a VR drum kit. Learn to drum with step by step lessons, flex your skills with the built-in rhythm game, and build your own custom kit from a library of 60+ percussive instruments without the limitations of money or physical space. Fun, intuitive drumming for pros and newcomers alike!\n\nKey Features:\n- Flex your skills in the built-in rhythm game mode: adjustable difficulty for 30 different songs, plus custom song support and cross-platform leaderboards.\n- Create your custom drum kit from a library of 60+ percussive instruments, from mallet instruments like the xylophone and steel drum, to auxiliary percussion such as bongos, tambourines and timpanis.\n- Pick up the basics with 10 beginner-friendly lessons, perfect for drumming newcomers.\n- Use the new multiplayer mode to perform for your friends in free play, or compete to get the high score playing the built-in songs.\n- MR passthrough support empowers you to play virtual drums in the real world. You can even connect and augment your physical kit with the rhythm game mode and lessons.\n- MIDI input/output support provides a powerful tool for composers, and also lets you augment your own electronic drum kit.\n- Set the mood with 4 different environments: Dojo, Jazz Club, Galaxy, Void.\n- USB and Bluetooth pedal support for kick and hi-hat.\n- Load your own songs, audio files and sheet music.\n- Easily save/load different kits and record your jam sessions.", "short_description": "Play drums without the limitations of the real world.\n\nSo much more than a VR drum kit. Learn to drum with step by step lessons, flex your skills with the built-in rhythm game, and build your own custom kit from a library of 60+ percussive instruments without the limitations of money or physical space. Fun, intuitive drumming for pros and newcomers alike!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://paradiddleapp.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Emre Tanirgan", "support_website_url": "http://paradiddleapp.com/faq", "website_url": "http://paradiddleapp.com/